14	  <section id="a" class="version active"><article class="card"><div class="eyebrow">To read</div><h2>JavaScript | MDN</h2><p>JavaScript is a programming language used to make web pages interactive.</p><div class="source">developer.mozilla.org</div><div class="labels"></div><div class="control"><input aria-label="New label" placeholder="Add a label…"><button class="add" data-add>Add label</button></div></article><p class="hint">Add the label directly on the bookmark.</p></section>
15	  <section id="b" class="version"><article class="card"><div class="eyebrow">To read</div><h2>JavaScript | MDN</h2><p>JavaScript is a programming language used to make web pages interactive.</p><div class="source">developer.mozilla.org</div><div class="labels"></div><div class="control"><button class="secondary" data-toggle>Labels</button><div class="popover"><input aria-label="New label" placeholder="Add a label…"><button class="add" data-add>Add</button></div></div></article><p class="hint">Open the label control, then add the label.</p></section>
16	  <section id="c" class="version"><article class="card"><div class="eyebrow">To read</div><h2>JavaScript | MDN</h2><p>JavaScript is a programming language used to make web pages interactive.</p><div class="source">developer.mozilla.org</div><div class="labels"></div><div class="control"><button class="secondary" data-edit>Edit bookmark</button></div></article><p class="hint">Open the bookmark editor, then add the label there.</p></section>
17	  <aside class="drawer" aria-label="Edit bookmark"><button class="secondary" data-close>Close</button><h2>Edit bookmark</h2><label>Title</label><input value="JavaScript | MDN"><label>Labels</label><input id="drawer-label" placeholder="Add a label…"><button class="add" data-drawer-add>Save changes</button></aside>
18	  <script>
